Prepare the AI Co-Founder daily brief. Read the current company priorities,
scorecard changes, open Kanban work, blockers, failed or aging tasks, pending
reviews, pending approvals, new risks, and material agent messages. Do not
create external writes or fabricate missing numbers. Lead with: what changed,
what matters today, decisions needed from the owner, and the three highest-value
owned actions. Include source/task references and clearly label unknowns.
